  "body_html": "<p>Disclaimer: By reading this article, you acknowledge and agree to the <a href=\"https://www.cluseau.com/p/disclaimer\">terms and conditions</a></p><h2>Kazakhstan</h2><p>Kaspi <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$KSPI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> reported earnings of $2.76, missing the consensus of $3.34 due to higher taxes and bank reserve requirements impacting its Fintech division, but there is more to the story here.</p><p>For several quarters Kaspi has been plagued by an absence of capital returns as it poured billions into its acquisition of Hepsiburada(the second largest E-commerce firm in Turkey). Now, Kaspi is finally turning its attention back onto the shareholders.</p><blockquote><p><strong>Letter from Mikhail Lomtadze:</strong></p><p>Two topics have dominated my conversations with investors over the last year: our progress in Türkiye and our approach to dividends. I want to address these and the other questions we hear most often, so that you better understand the context behind the decisions we’re taking.</p><p>Both Türkiye and dividends connect to a single ambition: to build Kaspi.kz into a 100 million user company. We believe that every strategic decision we make – the launch of new products and services, investments in Türkiye, and dividend policy – is anchored to this goal.</p></blockquote><p>Earlier today, Kaspi announced an 850 KZT dividend per ADS, which translates into roughly $1.71 at the current exchange rate. The company also stated it believes this dividend is now the baseline going forward.</p><blockquote><p>Based on the business's current performance and cash generation, we believe this is sustainable for the remainder of 2026.</p></blockquote><p>Absent any exchange rate fluctuations, $6.84 in annual dividends represents a roughly 9% yield, <em><strong>immediately vaulting Kaspi from a flailing “value trap” into a cash cow</strong></em>.</p><p>Even after lowering my 2026 EPS estimate to $11.75 USD (sharply below the $13.08 consensus), due to more stringent regulations on the banking sector and a higher effective tax rate, Kaspi at 6.5x earnings and a 9% dividend yield still represents a compelling setup.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png\" width=\"607\" height=\"416\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:416,&quot;width&quot;:607,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:26557,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/189658488?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-4Rv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff2434f65-b2d3-475e-a226-dc18d6b592b8_607x416.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Kaspi is a “superapp” in Kazakhstan, their proprietary payments, e-commerce marketplace, travel, lending, and grocery divisions dominate the country. Practically every Kazakh adult uses Kaspi. While the government has taken action to “open up” Kaspi’s QR payments division (to allow clients with bank accounts at other institutions to also receive payments), Kaspi’s position in e-commerce is unchallengeable, and remains highly linked to a growing Kazakh economy.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png\" width=\"1014\" height=\"624\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:624,&quot;width&quot;:1014,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:105475,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/189658488?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yGMA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbf10c48-0351-4fae-90fe-baea8072b461_1014x624.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>With a massive 9% dividend yield now in place, I believe the bottom for Kaspi is finally in. Kaspi is a growth name trading at a deep-value multiple, and I think the recent share buyback program paired with the long-awaited resumption of the dividend is finally enough to change the narrative. I have increased my position to 2% of my portfolio, and have orders to buy more in the $70-$75 range should it trade down in the coming days - Kaspi is a <strong>high conviction name for me</strong>. Based on the current multiple and implied 9% yield, I think a more reasonable valuation for Kaspi would be $90 a share, implying a 7.5% dividend yield and 7.5x 2026 earnings.</p><h2>Japan</h2><p>A lot of times I get asked if “it’s still a good time to add to Japanese positions”. It’s a good question, the Topix is up 50% in the last year and many Japanese Banks and value setups that previously traded at just 5-6x earnings now trade at 10-12x/ It’s hard to determine if the setups are still compelling at first glance.</p><p>An excellent guiding point, however, is if the <em><strong>company finds its own shares attractive</strong></em>. Unlike US-listed equities where share repurchases are reported quarterly, Japanese-listed equities announce share repurchase authorizations and buyback activity on a <em><strong>monthly basis</strong></em>, with detailed reports denoting the exact price and volume executed on an individual day reported <em><strong>at the end of the month</strong></em>.</p><p>While these disclosures mildly complicate buybacks since they tend to “tip the hand” of the company to investors (sometimes leading to buybacks being massively front run), they provide an excellent way to determine if a company still has an “appetite” for its shares after a run up in price.</p><p>One of the names we discussed last summer has been on an impressive 50% run, but February’s repurchase report indicates their appetite is just getting started and the setup is still highly compelling at just 0.61x Tangible Book Value.</p><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><p><em><strong>SE Holdings and Incubations (9478 JT Equity)</strong></em> remains my highest conviction Japanese equity position. The company looks like a publisher at first glance, but the real “gem” is its hidden investment portfolio and sizeable cash balance that amount to 2x the current market cap. Due to the nature of IFRS accounting and the fact that SE never trades its stock portfolio, SE’s unrealized gains in its investment portfolio never flow to earnings making the company appear “artificially” expensive as these earnings are never realized.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png\" width=\"735\" height=\"666\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:666,&quot;width&quot;:735,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:32901,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/189658488?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VDF2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffb52722d-f9e9-4e6a-9f31-4ad948a583f2_735x666.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>SE’s steady investment gains and sizeable share repurchases below book have driven record growth in Tangible Book Value per share, nearly 28% annualized since 2020.</p><p>With the Japanese Topix up 14% YTD, the HSI up 2%, and the broader MSCI APAC up 15%, all indications point to another strong quarter of investment income. The stock still trades at 0.63x Tangible Book Value of 690 Yen, and 0.61x Tangible Book Value of my estimated Q1 Net Asset Value of 723 Yen, and the company is taking <em><strong>full advantage of this discount as it executes its latest 250 Million Yen Share Repurchase Program.</strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png\" width=\"794\" height=\"815\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:815,&quot;width&quot;:794,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:69639,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/189658488?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XywU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fddb89b63-f049-4700-a8a0-a6dc937a3d01_794x815.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Last night’s filing indicates it repurchased 120,400 shares at an average price of 461 Yen in February, with 187.2 Million Yen remaining in capacity up until March 19th.</p><p>With just 10 Million floating shares, February’s buyback amounts to 1.2% of circulating shares. <strong>In my own positioning, I am using the 461 Yen average repurchase price as an “anchor”</strong> - if the company likes its own stock at 461 Yen, <strong>so do I, and certainly at 440 where it closed last night.</strong></p><p>I put smaller cap picks such as SE Holdings behind a paywall since the ideal setup for long-term valuation creation for these “discount-to-nav” setups is for them to continue purchasing sizeable quantities of shares at a large discount to Tangible Book Value, uninterrupted. Nonetheless, whether you’ve been in SE Holdings since <a href=\"https://www.cluseau.com/p/the-value-investors-paradise\">my original piece</a> at 317 Yen, or you are a new shareholder, I think the recent dip to 440 Yen presents a compelling opportunity: sizeable share repurchases are highly accretive to Tangible Book Value, and given the recent dip it is likely the company is <strong>even more aggressive</strong> in repurchasing shares.</p><p>I have orders in the 430 - 440 Yen range to take advantage of any additional dip and I believe the stock will slowly gravitate upwards to the 461 Yen average repurchase price as the company concludes its repurchase program this month. Long-term, I continue to be bullish on Japan, and SE Holdings <em><strong>provides an under-the-radar opportunity to gain exposure to Japanese equities at a significant discount</strong></em>.</p><h2>Trimming a Winner</h2><p>The <a href=\"https://www.cluseau.com/p/february-3-2026\">February 3</a> piece featured two new positions, IES Holdings $IESC, a leading provider of Communications and Infrastructure Solutions (an AI adjacent name) and Conduit Holdings (CRE LN), a reinsurer trading at a deep discount to Tangible Book Value.</p><p>Both names are up 15% since then, and <em><strong>I think it is time to begin taking profits in Conduit.</strong></em></p><p>Conduit’s sizeable repurchases (at times 160,000 shares a day - nearly 0.16% of the float) have placed significant upwards pressure on the stock, and the company intends to repurchase another $36 Million by May, which translates into roughly 80,000 shares of buying pressure every trading day until then.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png\" width=\"525\" height=\"371\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:371,&quot;width&quot;:525,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:54277,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/189658488?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FUJY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6cb9e713-76e6-403f-a5b8-e43a15ae317f_525x371.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Nonetheless, with the “earnings pop” out of the way, I think the stock at upwards of 0.85x Tangible Book Value is simply no longer a value setup and that profit taking here is warranted. I’ve trimmed my position just a few moments ago as the stock surges into the close, while Conduit is still somewhat attractively valued, I think there are better opportunities out there in insurance.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BYc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0fe305ae-6741-422e-9523-22122ec53320_1063x754.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4BYc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_au